# Multi-Agent Worktree Standards

When running parallel agents:

- Use one branch/worktree per feature slice.
- Keep each branch scoped to one logical unit of work.
- Require reviewer pass before merge for medium/high-risk changes.
- Call out shared contract changes explicitly (`API`, `SSE`, schema).
- Run targeted tests in each branch; run cross-feature smoke checks during integration.
- Update `docs/SESSION-HANDOFF.md` after integration milestones.

Reference workflow: `docs/workflows/multi-agent-worktree-playbook.md`.
